From 4e0c1be4a434a7017e73a8fe6ac5ee2b3e5c7bc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: usenamaodelivery <usenamaodelivery@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 16:29:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(orders): plug PWA into production Firestore
 (namao-delivery-prod)

- Adds firebase-admin SDK
- New src/lib/firestore.ts (admin SDK init from FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON env)
- New src/lib/orderStore.ts: same surface as store.ts but writes to Firestore
  when configured (falls back to mock for local dev)
- New src/lib/orderMapper.ts: schema mapping PWA <-> driver app
  - PWA awaiting_payment <-> driver waiting_confirmation
  - PWA searching       <-> driver pending
  - PWA accepted/picking_up <-> driver accepted
  - PWA in_transit      <-> driver in_transit
  - PWA delivered       <-> driver completed
- API routes /api/orders, /api/orders/[id], /api/orders/[id]/confirm-pix
  now use orderStore (real Firestore in prod)
- typecheck + build OK

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
